comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T08:33:49.248Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check (all statuses): searched GH-975, isAlreadyClaimedError, already_claimed_by, claim race, and SDK exports. pm-8t5x owns the closed atomic-claim behavior and pm-9x6e owns the closed public-boundary capstone, but no item owns the missing predicate export. This new open issue is canonical for #975."
  "2026-08-11T15:05:38.328Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence 2026-08-11: the public-surface test first failed with isAlreadyClaimedError not a function. The predicate is now exported from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk and /sdk/core and 25 focused lifecycle tests pass; packed-consumer proof remains in the release gate."
  "2026-08-11T15:14:10.280Z","harness:codex","Packed-consumer acceptance evidence: a tarball-installed ESM consumer exposed that instanceof PmCliError is false across duplicated SDK bundle identities. Added a cross-bundle regression, changed isAlreadyClaimedError to require Error + exact PmCliError name + context.code=already_claimed_by, repacked, and verified both node index.mjs execution and strict TypeScript 6 compilation with skipLibCheck=false. The packed consumer also completed npm audit with zero vulnerabilities."
  "2026-08-11T15:37:21.897Z","harness:codex","Repository-wide verification evidence: exact coverage gate passed 486 files / 7,230 tests at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Packed ESM runtime and strict downstream TypeScript consumer checks passed independently."
  "2026-08-11T16:20:44.732Z","harness:codex","Final acceptance 2026-08-11: the linked 25-test claim lifecycle run passed. A tarball-installed ESM consumer and strict TypeScript 6 NodeNext consumer passed with skipLibCheck disabled; the exact 7,234-test 100/100/100/100 gate, public snapshot, package, npx, plugin, external-package, contract, audit, and security gates all passed."
  "2026-08-11T16:25:26.366Z","harness:codex","Release-candidate evidence: installed managed pm-changelog 2026.8.9 matches the latest npm version; replace-mode generation added this closed item to Unreleased with its canonical GitHub item link."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T16:20:44.263Z","harness:codex",Public predicates crossing independently bundled entrypoints cannot rely on instanceof identity. Structural checks should retain strict name and stable context-code guards while still requiring a genuine Error object.
